IELTS.lesson({"test": 8, "part": 2, "title": "Test 8, Part 2 — the long turn", "candidate": "nour", "script": [{"who": "examiner", "text": "Now, I'm going to give you a topic and I'd like you to talk about it for one to two minutes.", "ar": "الآن، سأعطيكِ موضوعاً وأريدكِ أن تتحدّثي عنه مدة دقيقة إلى دقيقتين.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/93e218b519712f7a.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Before you talk you'll have one minute to think about what you're going to say. You can make some notes if you wish. Do you understand?", "ar": "قبل أن تتحدّثي سيكون لديكِ دقيقة واحدة للتفكير في ما ستقولينه. ويمكنكِ تدوين بعض الملاحظات إن أردتِ. هل هذا واضح؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5a7c17f0603cb77a.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Yes, I understand.", "ar": "نعم، واضح.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5972678d8dee60ee.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Here is some paper and a pencil for making notes, and here is your topic.", "ar": "هذه ورقة وقلم لتدوين الملاحظات، وهذا موضوعكِ.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/dcc80d495df59156.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "I'd like you to describe a time when you really noticed nature.", "ar": "أودّ منكِ أن تصفي مرّة انتبهتِ فيها فعلاً إلى الطبيعة.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/faecccfff16c68cf.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "You have one minute. I'll tell you when the minute is up.", "ar": "لديكِ دقيقة واحدة. سأخبركِ عندما تنتهي الدقيقة.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/2b1e1b3092896694.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "All right? Remember you have one to two minutes for this. Don't worry if I stop you. I'll tell you when the time is up. Can you start speaking now, please?", "ar": "حسناً؟ تذكّري أن لديكِ دقيقة إلى دقيقتين. لا تقلقي إن أوقفتكِ. سأخبركِ عندما ينتهي الوقت. هل يمكنكِ أن تبدئي الحديث الآن من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/12de1969ab105c17.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I will talk about when I was at my uncle's house, in the mountains near Zabadani. It was in the summer, last year I think, or two years ago.", "ar": "سأتحدّث عن حين كنت في بيت عمّي، في الجبال قرب الزبداني. كان ذلك في الصيف، السنة الماضية على ما أظنّ، أو قبل سنتين.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/8581c159d078b444.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I was with my family. My parents and my brother and also my cousins were there. It's a big house and everybody comes in the summer.", "ar": "كنت مع عائلتي. والداي وأخي وأولاد عمّي أيضاً كانوا هناك. إنّه بيت كبير والجميع يأتون في الصيف.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/56aa59a0ee86df39.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "What I noticed was the stars. In Damascus you cannot see the stars because there is too much light, but there, at night, there were so many.", "ar": "ما انتبهت إليه كان النجوم. في دمشق لا تستطيع أن ترى النجوم لأنّ الضوء كثير جداً، لكن هناك، في الليل، كانت كثيرة جداً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/047610e0e17268f4.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I was sitting outside and I looked up and it was really amazing.", "ar": "كنت جالسة في الخارج ونظرت إلى الأعلى وكان المنظر جميلاً فعلاً.", "shot": "two", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a3fa27239cd9b523.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "My brother was there also and we stayed outside for a long time.", "ar": "أخي كان هناك أيضاً وبقينا في الخارج وقتاً طويلاً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/fecaa92293579d35.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "It made me feel very peaceful. And also small, in a good way, because you see how big it is. It was a really nice feeling and I remember it.", "ar": "جعلني ذلك أشعر بهدوء شديد. وبأنّني صغيرة أيضاً، بمعنى جميل، لأنّك ترى كم هو كبير. كان شعوراً جميلاً فعلاً وما زلت أذكره.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/bcb2dabf9029117f.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Yes. So that was the time I noticed nature.", "ar": "نعم. إذاً تلك كانت المرّة التي انتبهت فيها إلى الطبيعة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/237e03047513e62f.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a time when you really noticed nature.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where you were</li><li>who you were with</li><li>what you noticed</li><li>and explain how it made you feel</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. Do you often go to the mountains?", "ar": "شكراً لكِ. هل تذهبين إلى الجبال كثيراً؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/dfd5b345495a5847.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Only in summer. Maybe two or three times.", "ar": "في الصيف فقط. مرّتين أو ثلاثاً ربّما.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/9429a41b979b9ed2.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That is the end of Part Two.", "ar": "شكراً لكِ. بهذا ينتهي القسم الثاني.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/264fec5248fac38c.mp3"}], "boxes": [{"q": "Describe a time when you really noticed nature.", "bullets": ["where you were", "who you were with", "what you noticed", "and explain how it made you feel"], "long": true, "model": "I will talk about when I was at my uncle's house, in the mountains near Zabadani. It was in the summer, last year I think, or two years ago. I was with my family. My parents and my brother and also my cousins were there. It's a big house and everybody comes in the summer. What I noticed was the stars. In Damascus you cannot see the stars because there is too much light, but there, at night, there were so many. I was sitting outside and I looked up and it was really amazing. My brother was there also and we stayed outside for a long time. It made me feel very peaceful. And also small, in a good way, because you see how big it is. It was a really nice feeling and I remember it. Yes. So that was the time I noticed nature.", "modelBand": 6.5, "why": "uncle's house, mountains family the stars nice / peaceful"}, {"q": "Do you often go to the mountains?", "model": "Only in summer. Maybe two or three times.", "modelBand": 6.5, "why": ""}], "voices": {"examiner": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "candidate": "piper-en_US-ljspeech-medium-s119"}});
